        "start": 321.96,
        "end": 327.49,
        "speaker": "Speaker",
        "en": "You need to enter every conversation assuming that you have something to learn.",
        "ipa": "/ju nid tu ˈɛntər ˈɛvri ˌkɑnvərˈseɪʃən əˈsumɪŋ ðæt ju hæv ˈsʌmθɪŋ tu lɜrn./",
