        "speaker": "Speaker",
        "en": "If you put in a complicated question, you're going to get a simple answer out.",
        "ipa": "/ɪf ju pʊt ɪn ə ˈkɑmpləˌkeɪtəd ˈkwɛstʃən, jʊr ˈɡoʊɪŋ tu ɡɛt ə ˈsɪmpəl ˈænsər aʊt/",
